  5%|▍         | 23/500 [04:17<1:08:18,  8.59s/it]['I-90'] {'response': 'New York State Route 146, Interstate 890, and New York State Route 337 all run through Schenectady, New York. NY 337 is a short state highway that connects NY 7 to Interstate 890 along the western edge of the city of Schenectady and passes by the Rotterdam Square shopping mall. Therefore, these three routes are significant thoroughfares in the Schenectady area.', 'query': 'Route 146, Interstate 890, and what other highway all run through Schenectady, New York?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'New York State Route\xa0146 (NY\xa0146) is a state highway in the Capital District of New York in the United States. It extends for 43 mi from Gallupville at NY\xa0443 to near Mechanicville at U.S. Route\xa04 (US\xa04) and NY\xa032. NY\xa0146 is a major thoroughfare in the city of Schenectady, just outside Albany.', 'node_id': '8eedb8f5-4d96-4a1f-ae6b-3a49bbe02019', 'score': 0.4957391917705536}, {'text': 'New York State Route\xa0890 (NY\xa0890) is a 1.00 mi long state highway located northwest of downtown Schenectady in the Capital District of New York in the United States. Although the route runs north–south, it is signed as east–west to match the posted direction of Interstate\xa0890 (I-890), of which NY\xa0890 is an extension.', 'node_id': '3e84908a-8a1f-4853-8cc4-d0828a61816b', 'score': 0.5807400941848755}, {'text': 'Interstate 890 (I-890) is a 9.45 mi long auxiliary Interstate Highway in the vicinity of Schenectady, New York, in the United States. The highway runs southeast–northwest from an interchange with the New York State Thruway (I-90) northwest of Schenectady to another junction with the Thruway south of the city and passes through Downtown Schenectady along the way. Most of I-890 is six lanes wide, including a section that runs above an industrial section of Schenectady on an elevated highway.', 'node_id': '8e3e528b-d578-4bb5-9bf9-d1de4a6b246d', 'score': 0.5849824547767639}, {'text': 'New York State Route\xa0146A (NY\xa0146A) is a state highway in New York State. It begins at NY\xa0146 in Clifton Park and ends at NY\xa050 in Ballston Lake. It is located entirely within Saratoga County. Route\xa0146A is the last existing spur of NY\xa0146 in Saratoga and Schenectady counties.', 'node_id': '8eeeef27-fc45-4747-9a4f-ac18fecda8bf', 'score': 0.6596602201461792}, {'text': 'New York State Route\xa0337 (NY\xa0337) is a short state highway located entirely within the Town of Rotterdam in Schenectady County, New York. It forms a connection from NY\xa07 to Interstate\xa0890 along the western edge of the city of Schenectady and passes by the Rotterdam Square shopping mall.', 'node_id': 'b317d09d-2624-40d2-8871-dce47736eaa0', 'score': 0.7087340950965881}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.0619794856756926, 'vram_usage': 1.28271484375}
