 generally considered conservative.", 'node_id': 'a690cdbc-1af8-4193-9230-254a50832c24', 'score': 1.2661112546920776}, {'text': 'Larry Richard Williams (born October 6, 1942) is an American author, stock and commodity trader, and politician from the state of Montana. He is the father of four-time Academy Award and one-time Tony Award nominee actress Michelle Williams.', 'node_id': 'c4b41d2a-2df5-4592-a717-e52560a54131', 'score': 1.2889903783798218}, {'text': 'Associates of PSI include: Mathew Atha, Colin Angus, Brian Barritt, Michael Carmichael, Fraser Clark, Paul Devereux, the late John Entwistle, Paul Flynn MP, Ben Ganly, Lee Harris, Mike Jay, Howard Marks, Dr John Marks, Jonathan Ott, Dr Russell Newcombe, Richard Rudgley and Youth.', 'node_id': '68add95d-b361-45c4-8411-11d73be5570e', 'score': 1.2936079502105713}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.887398486956954, 'vram_usage': 1.20068359375}
