 recorded from Nova Scotia to Florida, west to Texas and north to Saskatchewan. The habitat consists of deciduous and mixed woodlands.', 'node_id': 'bef36a19-21c5-4f78-a913-140f779465b4', 'score': 1.0239758491516113}, {'text': 'Indogrammodes is a genus of moths of the Crambidae family. It contains only one species, Indogrammodes pectinicornalis, which is found in India.', 'node_id': '92506ae3-c547-48f1-b150-b37cc9d62115', 'score': 1.0593304634094238}, {'text': 'Smerinthus minor (lesser eyed hawkmoth) is a moth of the family Sphingidae. It was described by Mell in 1937. It is a montane species found from the Taibai Shan area, western Qinling Mountains in Shaanxi, China eastwards along the Qinling to southern Shanxi and then north to just west of Beijing. It has also been recorded from the Miaofeng Mountains near Beijing and the Wuling Mountains in Hunan.', 'node_id': '8988706f-9ad5-4218-85aa-e9ee97305f6a', 'score': 1.0897481441497803}, {'text': 'Yoshiyasua is a grass moth genus (family Crambidae) of subfamily Musotiminae. Some authors have placed it in the snout moth family (Pyralidae), where all grass moths were once also included, but this seems to be in error. The genus contains only one species, Yoshiyasua yasudai, which is found in Japan, where it has been recorded from the Ryukyu Islands.', 'node_id': '3a03bbb6-f332-447a-ac76-5e4c80ca7a72', 'score': 1.1154319047927856}, {'text': 'Porthecla peruensis is a butterfly in the Lycaenidae family. It is found in northern Peru, on the east side of the Andes. It appears to be a montane species, since it has only been found at altitudes above 1,500 meters.', 'node_id': '30671032-36b7-4f0f-a180-c277cb65a768', 'score': 1.1353881359100342}, {'text': 'Most species of South America are known only from the coast of Colombia and Venezuela, including the islands of Aruba, Curaçao, Bonaire and Trinidad. The genus is not revised yet, but apparently have a Neotropical distribution.', 'node_id': 'f0450dac-8cba-48da-a2e8-7ebfefe6cd80', 'score': 1.2220879793167114}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.6166839338839054, 'vram_usage': 1.23583984375}
