 21%|██        | 104/500 [16:23<1:05:21,  9.90s/it]['Max Gail'] {'response': 'The actor in the film D.C. Cab who also had a role in the TV series Barney Miller is Max Gail. In Barney Miller, he portrayed the character Detective Stan "Wojo" Wojciehowicz. Max Gail is known for his work in both television and film, and his role in Barney Miller is one of his most notable performances.', 'query': 'What actor in the film D.C. Cab also had a role in the TV series Barney Miller?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'D.C. Cab (also known as Street Fight) is a 1983 American comedy film, starring Max Gail, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, and Whitman Mayo. The film was written and directed by Joel Schumacher with the story by Topper Carew & Schumacher.', 'node_id': '0958ab9b-2ec8-4df7-aa2a-216f7f7a3d59', 'score': 0.7798707485198975}, {'text': 'Ronald Joseph Cicenia (December 11, 1935 – January 16, 2007), known as Ron Carey, was an American film and television actor. The 5 ft actor was best known for playing ambitious NYPD Police Officer Carl Levitt on TV\'s "Barney Miller", in which he was almost always surrounded by male actors (and sometimes female guest stars) who stood at least 4 in taller. The series\' stars (Hal Linden, Max Gail, Abe Vigoda, Ron Glass, Steve Landesberg) all stood 6 ft or more.', 'node_id': '76d42a50-ebfb-4ea0-98fe-cbb12c1158c1', 'score': 0.7799158096313477}, {'text': 'Steve Landesberg (November 23, 1936December 20, 2010) was an American actor, comedian, and voice actor known for his role as the erudite, unflappable police detective Arthur P. Dietrich on the ABC sitcom "Barney Miller", for which he was nominated for three Emmy Awards.', 'node_id': 'd214a35e-93ef-4a97-a2d7-03f0cdc99097', 'score': 0.8441236019134521}, {'text': 'Maxwell Trowbridge "Max" Gail Jr. (born April 5, 1943) is an American actor who has starred in stage, television, and film roles. He most notably portrayed the role of Detective Stan "Wojo" Wojciehowicz on the television sitcom "Barney Miller".', 'node_id': 'f5b98f39-b594-479c-ad90-8317e3bb3094', 'score': 0.8515191078186035}, {'text': 'Carey appeared in the recurring role for the last six of the eight seasons of "Barney Miller"\' s run. He first appeared on the show as a criminal, Angelo Molinari (aka The Mole), in Season 2, Episode 22.', 'node_id': '62f3caeb-607c-4a16-b602-ce8d431aff82', 'score': 0.885746955871582}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.0295917857438326, 'vram_usage': 1.27099609375}
