['attack on Pearl Harbor'] {'response': "The provided context is insufficient regarding Magruder Hill Tuttle's involvement or status as a senior officer in the United States Navy during the time of the attack on Pearl Harbor. However, it does mention that the attack on Pearl Harbor was a surprise military strike by the Imperial Japanese Navy Air Service against the United States naval base at Pearl Harbor, Hawaii Territory, on the morning of December 7, 1941. This attack led to the United States' entry into World War II.", 'query': 'Which event was a surprise military strike by the Imperial Japanese Navy Air Service while Magruder Hill Tuttle was a senior officer in the United States Navy?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': "The attack on Pearl Harbor was a surprise military strike by the Imperial Japanese Navy Air Service against the United States naval base at Pearl Harbor, Hawaii Territory, on the morning of December 7, 1941. The attack, also known as the Battle of Pearl Harbor, led to the United States' entry into World War II. The Japanese military leadership referred to the attack as the Hawaii Operation and Operation AI, and as Operation Z during its planning.", 'node_id': 'cd48c505-83e9-416c-a9cd-8b94bc9daa5c', 'score': 3.7701097}, {'text': 'The Imperial Japanese Navy fielded naval paratroopers during World War II. The troops were officially part of the Special Naval Landing Forces (SNLF or "Rikusentai"). They came from the 1st, 2nd and 3rd Yokosuka SNLFs. The 2nd Yokosuka took no part in any airborne operations and became an island defensive base unit. They were under the operational control of the Imperial Japanese Navy Air Service (IJNAS or "Dai-Nippon Teikoku Kaigun Koku Hombu").', 'node_id': '7c64428c-8fd1-4547-8fca-ee7f2e2f4af4', 'score': -1.5244919}, {'text': 'The Imperial Japanese Navy Air Service (大日本帝國海軍航空隊 , Dai-Nippon Teikoku Kaigun Kōkū-tai ) was the air arm of the Imperial Japanese Navy during World War II. The organization was responsible for the operation of naval aircraft and the conduct of aerial warfare in the Pacific War.', 'node_id': '97539209-3a25-42c1-8a34-8aa655738cdf', 'score': -2.3576403}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.3535502720624208, 'vram_usage': 12.52880859375}
