['state capital'] {'response': 'Marion is approximately 50 mi north of Knoxville, which is the third-most populous city in Tennessee. Knoxville is located in Knox County, Tennessee, which had a population of 432,226 as of the 2010 census. Therefore, Marion is situated north of a city that holds significant population status within the state.', 'query': ' Marion is approximately 50 mi north of a city that is the third-most populous what in the U.S.?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Marion is a city in and the county seat of Marion County, Ohio, United States. The municipality is located in north-central Ohio, approximately 50 mi north of Columbus.', 'node_id': 'fee982cc-905f-4bd6-bbc7-b2f153245611', 'score': 15.390486717224121}, {'text': 'Santa Fe de Antioquia is a municipality in the Antioquia Department, Colombia. The city is located approximately 50 mi north of Medellín, the department capital. It has a population of approximately 23,000 inhabitants.', 'node_id': '1baec0df-4e9b-4214-baae-981823dc4193', 'score': 12.300979614257812}, {'text': 'Cambridge ( ) is a university city and the county town of Cambridgeshire, England, on the River Cam approximately 50 mi north of London. At the United Kingdom Census 2011, its population was 123,867, including 24,488 students.', 'node_id': '54cadb83-220a-4909-a02e-f037264c4480', 'score': 11.080297470092773}, {'text': 'Rohnert Park is a city in Sonoma County, California, United States, located approximately 50 mi north of San Francisco. The population at the 2010 United States Census was 40,971. It is an early planned city and is the sister city of Hashimoto in Japan. Sonoma State University, part of the California State University system, is located nearby.', 'node_id': '426e1f31-9884-43fb-925d-bfd39dc6d5f3', 'score': 10.16082763671875}, {'text': 'Atlee or Atlee Station is an unincorporated community in northerneastern Hanover County in the Mid-Atlantic state of Virginia, United States. Atlee is located 11 mi north of Richmond on Route 637 approximately .6 mi north-northwest of the intersection of Route 637 and Virginia State Route 2. and approximately 50 mi south of Fredericksburg, Virginia', 'node_id': '8c73db41-3d1b-4a7f-8d9e-e18ebc56693f', 'score': 9.513465881347656}, {'text': 'The most populous city in the country is the capital, Mexico City, with a population of 8.9 million (2016), and its metropolitan area is also the most populated with 20.1 million (2010). Approximately 50% of the population lives in one of the 55 large metropolitan areas in the country. In total, about 78.84% of the population of the country lives in urban areas, meaning that only 21.16% live in rural areas.', 'node_id': 'af54de07-b855-4b1b-a8b7-e78370d9eefb', 'score': 9.222551345825195}, {'text': 'Knox County is a county in the U.S. state of Tennessee. As of the 2010 census, the population was 432,226, making it the third-most populous county in Tennessee. Its county seat is Knoxville, the third-most populous city in Tennessee.', 'node_id': 'a46ce794-27c1-4be4-be82-86ccd254070f', 'score': 7.830333709716797}, {'text': 'New Paltz is a village in Ulster County located in the U.S. state of New York. It is about 80 mi north of New York City and 70 mi south of Albany. The population was 6,818 at the 2010 census.', 'node_id': 'e7ac4ecb-8a29-4e2e-8a6c-388315595f66', 'score': 7.500045299530029}, {'text': 'Blue Flint Ethanol is an bioethanol producing company and a production plant with a same name, located in Underwood, North Dakota approximately 50 mi north of Bismarck. The plant is unique in the fact that rather than burning fuels, such as coal or natural gas to drive the production process, waste heat from electrical generation at the Coal Creek Station is used.', 'node_id': '92c81745-1b74-403d-a73e-e331c3f266a2', 'score': 7.305002689361572}, {'text': 'Weston is a village and civil parish in the South Holland district of Lincolnshire, England. It is situated approximately 2 mi north-east from the town of Spalding. The Civil Parish also includes Weston Hills. The population of the civil parish including Austendike was at the 2011 census 2,054.', 'node_id': '802a682f-0698-4131-b8b5-302a5fe85d0f', 'score': 7.085651397705078}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 3.857595404610038, 'vram_usage': 0.0}
