 40%|███▉      | 199/500 [34:48<1:12:00, 14.35s/it] 40%|████      | 200/500 [35:02<1:10:35, 14.12s/it]['Lyudmila Stefanovna Petrushevskaya'] {'response': 'The Time: Night is a novella by Russian author Lyudmila Petrushevskaya. She is known for her contributions to literature, including this work, which was originally published in the literary journal "Novy Mir" in 1992 and later translated into English. The novella was also shortlisted for the Russian Booker Prize, highlighting its significance in Russian literature.', 'query': 'The Time: Night, is a novella by which Russian writer, novelist and playwright?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'The Time: Night (Russian: Время ночь ) is a novella by Russian author Lyudmila Petrushevskaya. It was originally published in Russian in the literary journal "Novy Mir" in 1992 and translated into English by Sally Laird in 1994. In 1992 it was shortlisted for the Russian Booker Prize.', 'node_id': 'ff65b197-07b2-4edd-8663-a2183809cb3f', 'score': 0.2489418387413025}, {'text': 'Sonechka is a novella and collection of short stories by Russian writer Lyudmila Ulitskaya. It was originally published in Russian in the literary journal "Novy Mir" in 1992, and translated into English by Arch Tait in 2005. "Sonechka" was nominated for the Russian Booker Prize.', 'node_id': '58822c0d-748d-4eb1-92a2-8e18c0c472b5', 'score': 0.9778958559036255}, {'text': 'Uncle\'s Dream (Russian: Дядюшкин сон , "Dyadushkin son") is an 1859 novella by Russian writer Fyodor Dostoyevsky.', 'node_id': 'b2534eaf-82d7-49d8-af81-f922dcabd509', 'score': 0.9826958775520325}, {'text': 'There writing under the pseudonym Marlinsky (Russian: Марли́нский ; ] ) he became known as a romantic poet, short story writer and novelist. He was killed there in a skirmish.', 'node_id': 'cf6d099b-0cdc-4d76-98ed-6046f40eba95', 'score': 1.0106688737869263}, {'text': 'As a writer he is best known for the novella "The Remote House on Vasilyevsky Island" (Уединённый домик на Васильевском), which was influenced by the writings of Aleksandr Pushkin.', 'node_id': '61348308-41dd-4390-bccb-bde35f80f97f', 'score': 1.0147783756256104}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 1.0312572568655014, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
