 40%|████      | 201/500 [35:18<1:13:27, 14.74s/it]['Lawrence M. Tanenbaum'] {'response': "Toronto's Insight Sports is partially owned by Larry Tanenbaum, who is a Canadian businessman and the chairman of Maple Leaf Sports & Entertainment (MLSE). He owns a 25% stake in MLSE through his holding company, Kilmer Sports Inc.", 'query': "Toronto's Insight Sports is partially owned by what Canadian businessman?", 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Insight Sports Ltd. is a sports media and entertainment company based in Toronto, Ontario, Canada. The company is owned in part by Larry Tanenbaum, part owner of Maple Leaf Sports & Entertainment.', 'node_id': '452b30dd-c203-464d-92de-41d6a9c39899', 'score': 0.4107844829559326}, {'text': 'The Canadian Premier League is a proposed fully professional, FIFA-sanctioned soccer league expected to begin play as early as 2018. Six to eight teams owned and operated, at least in part, by a mix of NHL and CFL ownership groups are expected to initially compete in the league. The league\'s focus will be to fully "Canadianize" itself to improve talent and the sport in Canada. It was officially sanctioned by the Canadian Soccer Association on May 6, 2017, with a launch date of 2018. It is expected to be headquartered in Hamilton, Ontario.', 'node_id': 'f88fe43d-854f-4e24-bb0e-a6619c0b444e', 'score': 0.9779443144798279}, {'text': 'Lawrence M. Tanenbaum {\'1\': ", \'2\': ", \'3\': ", \'4\': "} (born 1945) is a Canadian businessman and chairman of Maple Leaf Sports & Entertainment (MLSE). He owns a 25% stake in MLSE through his holding company Kilmer Sports Inc.', 'node_id': '41c356cd-99da-4224-80d9-39878f9e99f2', 'score': 0.9804190397262573}, {'text': 'He is currently Director of Player Development for the Tampa Bay Lightning of the National Hockey League.', 'node_id': '759d4c5b-8aed-4f5c-97bb-bf4ba6200fbd', 'score': 1.0969007015228271}, {'text': "In 1891, the Canadian assets of the company were purchased by its chief rival there, the Hudson's Bay Company.", 'node_id': 'c27659bd-c203-4eea-b619-d4263edad43d', 'score': 1.1195311546325684}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.183776579797268, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
