contains 18\xa0civil parishes, which are distributed around its periphery. Its central area, including the town, is unparished. This list contains the 141\xa0structures in the unparished area that are designated by English Heritage as listed buildings and included in the National Heritage List for England. Of these, three buildings are listed at Grade\xa0I, and ten at Grade\xa0II*. The remaining buildings are listed at Grade\xa0II. The listed buildings in the civil parishes are included in separate lists.', 'node_id': '9e523cc1-f974-4272-8d4d-f4d34b7c8e71', 'score': 1.168076992034912}, {'text': 'The South-East Region (coded IE024) is a NUTS Level III statistical region of Ireland. It consists of the territory of the city of Waterford and of the counties of Carlow, Kilkenny, South Tipperary, Wexford, and Waterford. The South-East region spans 9,406\xa0km, 13.5% of the total area of the state and according to the 2006 census has a population of 460,838.', 'node_id': '0a60631c-a221-4c0b-bf50-ccc616b244ea', 'score': 1.2254462242126465}, {'text': 'Part of Blennerville electoral division falls within the area of Tralee Town Council, and at the 2011 census had a population of 141. The remaining portion, outside the urban boundaries, had a 2011 population of 556.', 'node_id': '7a16b136-9246-43d0-9d32-d9e3fc4889c0', 'score': 1.2274394035339355}, {'text': 'Wan Chai District Council () is the district council for the Wan Chai District in Hong Kong. It is one of 18 district councils. Wan Chai District currently consists of 13 members, of which the district is divided into 13 constituencies, electing a total of 13 members. The latest election was held on 22 November 2015.', 'node_id': '391b837d-6bb9-4628-b6e7-adb67f0597d3', 'score': 1.3120081424713135}, {'text': 'The district was expanded in 1990 to include more of Chestnut Hill Road and Essex Road, Suffolk Road and the roads between it and Hammond, and a small section south of the Green Line including properties on Hammond Street, Longwood Road, and Middlesex Road. A further expansion in 1999 added a single property on Suffolk Road.', 'node_id': '778a7bab-a449-4568-a513-54b57b923c9c', 'score': 1.3121416568756104}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8919872157275677, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
