nada\'s Top Ten Adventurers by Explore Magazine, and in 2015 he was named One of Canada\'s Top 100 Explorers by Canadian Geographic Magazine.', 'node_id': '1ed0eb77-b2e7-4086-9216-0c8debdda1fc', 'score': 1.2168322801589966}, {'text': 'The Edgemont Neighborhood is just one of many examples of how Durham became one of the more progressive and tolerant locations for African Americans in the country.', 'node_id': 'c430f99e-632a-43ab-86aa-65be7e6a3a9a', 'score': 1.2406316995620728}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.0768853183835745, 'vram_usage': 1.27099609375}
