7, the chain grew to about 80 restaurants and changed owners several times before shrinking to only four stores. The company is based in Milwaukie, Oregon.", 'node_id': '4226431c-1323-4c20-9445-bd82dfdf3001', 'score': 0.9513483643531799}, {'text': 'Pacific International Enterprises (PIE) is an American film production company and film distributor, founded by Arthur R. Dubs as a producer of family films. PIE is a privately held company that has been in business for over thirty years as ""A Universal Force in Family Film Entertainment"". Their films have been continually licensed and re-licensed for television by various channels such as HBO, Disney, TNT, CBS and in over 100 countries worldwide.', 'node_id': '9c596d1e-5cda-4393-90be-77707bbc260c', 'score': 1.1660350561141968}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.2087434455752373, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
