ns in the female competition since the introduction of the Open Era in 1968 and is third all-time behind Margaret Court (24) and Serena Williams (23).', 'node_id': 'fb4d3676-c832-4d7b-8b02-0264858b9d23', 'score': 0.7616937756538391}, {'text': 'This is a list of the main career statistics of Spanish professional tennis player, Garbiñe Muguruza. To date, Muguruza has won five WTA singles titles – most significantly the 2016 French Open and the 2017 Wimbledon Championships– and five WTA doubles titles.', 'node_id': '251edb63-3de4-4372-996e-a0940a13cb0a', 'score': 0.8356404304504395}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.2344357129186392, 'vram_usage': 1.23583984375}
