te University she won the 80 m hurdles event at the 1963 Pan American Games.', 'node_id': 'e3c202d5-3792-4d9f-84fa-2b3a5430d6d8', 'score': 1.197696566581726}, {'text': 'Jane Alexander (born October 28, 1939) is an American author, actress and former director of the National Endowment for the Arts. She is a Tony Award winner and two-time Emmy Award winner.', 'node_id': 'f99a723b-63ce-4974-99fe-8a75a642616f', 'score': 1.2072503566741943}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.6486774552613497, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
