d to singer Lupita Palomera, who died in 2008. Fernando Fernández was known as "the Crooner of Mexico."', 'node_id': '0bab1cef-4752-4b39-b0e2-bd5a82addfbe', 'score': 0.9585041403770447}, {'text': 'The 2nd TCA Awards were presented by the Television Critics Association. The ceremony was held on June 10, 1986, at the Beverly Wilshire Hotel in Los Angeles, Calif.', 'node_id': '9e79ff8f-b924-4815-bb32-023293f85718', 'score': 0.9830183982849121}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.1514614261686802, 'vram_usage': 1.30615234375}
