-c853-478a-884a-160f8643aa10', 'score': 0.8898871541023254}, {'text': 'men’s gymnastics team in olympic history. In addition to the team gold medal, he earned an individual bronze medal on the pommel horse. In 2005, he was inducted into the United States Olympic Hall of Fame.', 'node_id': 'a422176a-38df-499f-8877-77ce23c318af', 'score': 0.9091144800186157}, {'text': 'Lavinia Corina Miloșovici (born 21 October 1976) is a retired Romanian artistic gymnast. An exceptionally successful athlete on the international competition circuit, Miloșovici, also known as "Milo" in the gymnastics community, is considered to be one of Romania\'s top gymnasts of the 1990s and one of the most prolific female all-around gymnasts of the decade, earning a total 19 World Championships or Olympic medals in a span of six years.', 'node_id': '5a2796eb-ba58-45da-ab81-f76d872330b3', 'score': 0.9521499872207642}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8798281792551279, 'vram_usage': 1.25927734375}
