ished music scene of East Germany. Many members of these bands played significant parts during the time of political change "Wende" in 1989. The bands came from a broad range of musical genres, especially Punk, Blues, Wave, Indie and Electronic music.', 'node_id': '30c3729a-bdbd-402f-9893-848933e7c548', 'score': 1.0495421886444092}, {'text': "While the quintet's debut was met with lukewarm receptions, their follow-ups cemented their popularity, becoming one of the best-selling digital group of all-time in Asia and one of the best-selling boy bands in the world.", 'node_id': '61dfe8c4-58d6-4c4c-bcac-9cdce02d31a9', 'score': 1.0597482919692993}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.1312369983643293, 'vram_usage': 1.18896484375}
