'score': 1.007379412651062}, {'text': "The album debuted #1 on the ear X-tacy sales chart, #92 on the CIMS sales chart, #20 on R&R's specialty chart, and #7 on FMQB's Submodern Report.", 'node_id': 'ae9e46bc-ef90-4041-9404-cf8c2afd4376', 'score': 1.0459306240081787}, {'text': 'In the US, the track reached number 59 on the "Billboard" Hot 100 singles chart, becoming the band\'s second single to hit the chart after "There\'s No Other Way". It also reached number 4 on the Modern Rock songs chart.', 'node_id': '55c8d85b-6775-4842-bc23-72a252ffa8b7', 'score': 1.0482990741729736}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.0264555513858795, 'vram_usage': 1.30615234375}
