 67%|██████▋   | 335/500 [1:00:41<35:50, 13.03s/it]['Katelyn Tarver'] {'response': 'Rick Seibold has worked with Katelyn Tarver, who is known for her recurring role as Jo Taylor on the Nickelodeon series "Big Time Rush." Katelyn Tarver is not only an actress but also a singer, and her involvement in "Big Time Rush" connects her to the context of Rick Seibold\'s collaborations.', 'query': 'Rick Seibold has worked with what artist known for her role in "Big Time Rush"?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Rick Seibold ( ; born April 16, 1983) is an American singer-songwriter from Wilmington, North Carolina, now based in Los Angeles. Seibold has received considerable recognition as an independent recording artist from his debut record "That\'s the Day". He has worked with artists such as Lee DeWyze, David Archuleta, Katelyn Tarver, Kat DeLuna, and Alex Lambert.', 'node_id': 'fdfbf910-036f-40af-beac-42534f050fc0', 'score': 0.7359647750854492}, {'text': 'Carlos Roberto PenaVega (born Carlos Roberto Pena Jr.; August 15, 1989) is an American actor and singer. He is best known for starring on the Nickelodeon series "Big Time Rush" as Carlos García in addition to being a member of the band Big Time Rush. He was the host of the Nickelodeon game show "Webheads".', 'node_id': 'aa923086-0dd2-41fd-9ae3-46454eed7a9a', 'score': 0.8668361902236938}, {'text': 'Big Time Rush (also known as BTR) was an American boy band pop group formed in 2009. The group consisted of Kendall Schmidt, James Maslow, Logan Henderson, and Carlos Pena, Jr. The group starred in Nickelodeon\'s television series "Big Time Rush" and signed to a record deal with Nick Records simultaneously with the television series, and then the group was eventually signed to Columbia Records. The show ran from November 28, 2009 to July 25, 2013. The pilot episode featured the group\'s first promotional single, "Big Time Rush".', 'node_id': '432e93ae-f05f-4d8a-9a62-695bd46ee6e5', 'score': 0.9951340556144714}, {'text': 'Big Time Concert (also known as Big Time First Concert) is the 2010 second made-for-television movie of the series film franchise/season one finale for the television series, "Big Time Rush". It stars Kendall Schmidt, James Maslow, Carlos Pena Jr., Logan Henderson, Ciara Bravo, and Stephen Kramer Glickman. It premiered on Nickelodeon on August 20, 2010 at 8:00 p.m. ET. This movie included many recurring and guest star roles.', 'node_id': 'bf405b48-96b2-4d27-bf61-d731a05e900c', 'score': 1.0506588220596313}, {'text': 'Katelyn Tarver (born November 2, 1989) is an American actress and singer. She is known for her recurring roles as Jo Taylor on the Nickelodeon series "Big Time Rush", Natalie on the ABC series "No Ordinary Family", and Mercedes on ABC Family "The Secret Life of the American Teenager".', 'node_id': '48f8fbe8-7a10-4e24-b2da-8c76d7efab5c', 'score': 1.1106994152069092}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.9174517598003149, 'vram_usage': 1.25927734375}
