rry Seinfeld\'s series "Seinfeld", which went on to become one of the most popular and successful television sitcoms of all time. He was also the head of NBC\'s late night programming during the Conan O\'Brien and Jay Leno conflict in 2010.', 'node_id': '5333a47d-eb93-4914-93d5-98959e5f9f6e', 'score': 1.1398416757583618}, {'text': 'James Loach (born 6 June 1969) is an English film director. He is the son of the film director Ken Loach.', 'node_id': 'af2fea65-1df3-48c9-a88f-9291fb18f1c2', 'score': 1.141993761062622}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.8393850345164537, 'vram_usage': 1.18896484375}
