everal projects associated with Ricky Gervais, most notably as Kevin \'Kev\' Twine in the sitcom "Derek", and in smaller roles in "Extras" and the film "Cemetery Junction". He also co-wrote and starred in the sitcom "Rovers" for Sky 1 with Joe Wilkinson.', 'node_id': '88c3023d-ea04-4fab-82e7-f6f906c62b66', 'score': 1.1180524826049805}, {'text': "And There's More is a comedy sketch show starring Jimmy Cricket produced by Central Independent Television for ITV from 1985 till 1988.", 'node_id': 'aa1e4856-8033-447a-9b3e-259e4a088c2e', 'score': 1.1327892541885376}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.126593792811036, 'vram_usage': 1.7998046875}
