nown for making movies with contemporary supernatural plots and surprise endings.', 'node_id': '4c5a3370-de65-41ec-ad00-b40599726849', 'score': 1.0555763244628906}, {'text': 'The film stars Ankush Hazra, Mimi Chakraborty in lead role. The film is a remake of the 2007 Kannada film "Milana".', 'node_id': '08dd471b-2662-4060-8699-497413a78c94', 'score': 1.055769443511963}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.7286439929157495, 'vram_usage': 1.32958984375}
