eturn to host and was replaced by Aditya Narayan, son of playback singer, Udit Narayan.', 'node_id': '0a016429-fa63-49dd-a4d0-0a353c3f572d', 'score': 1.2928812503814697}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 1.4141726735979319, 'vram_usage': 1.27099609375}
