embly of the Yukon Territory in Canada. It was created in 1992 from an amalgamation of the ridings of Whitehorse North Centre and Whitehorse South Centre and readjusted in 2002 following the dissolution of the neighbouring riding of Riverside. The riding encompasses the downtown core of the City of Whitehorse (including Marwell) between the escarpment and the Yukon River. Whitehorse Centre is home to most of Whitehorse's businesses and government offices.", 'node_id': '6de08d3f-50a2-42b3-b79a-cce81ce54115', 'score': 1.0037693977355957}, {'text': 'In 2010, Dragonair, together with its parent, Cathay Pacific, operated over 138,000 flights, carried nearly 27 million passengers and over 1.80\xa0billion kg of cargo and mail.', 'node_id': '39333c6f-b4c8-4a41-8c0c-350103caafeb', 'score': 1.0893521308898926}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.0994203817099333, 'vram_usage': 1.20068359375}
