['Carlos Arturo Bacca Ahumada'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding which Colombian striker wears the Nike Mercurial Vapor football shoe.', 'query': 'The Nike Mercurial Vapor is a football shoe worn by which Colombian striker?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'The Mercurial Vapor is a football boot manufactured by Nike. The boot is known for being lightweight.', 'node_id': '8ac34d97-3bcc-4726-880a-e5454a272c9b', 'score': 15.42634105682373}, {'text': 'The Nike Cortez is the first track shoe created by Nike, in 1972, and is therefore thought to be a significant aspect to the success of Nike, Inc. The Nike Cortez was first designed by Nike co-founder Bill Bowerman. Bowerman, an Olympic-class track coach, felt that athletes needed a comfortable and durable running shoe designed for distance training and road running. The Nike Cortez was released at the peak of the 1972 Olympics, which is why it gained rapid exponential interest by the general public.', 'node_id': 'b76b6cbb-27fb-4416-b158-774da8fe42e4', 'score': 10.006511688232422}, {'text': 'A flamenco shoe is a type of shoe worn by flamenco dancers. They are typically worn by female dancers, they are called flamenco heel, often with traje de flamenca costumes. Male flamenco dancers traditionally wear short, heeled boots, although there are now some flamenco shoe styles available for men.', 'node_id': '5ad56882-bc14-4d32-b0cb-fe0309cea18e', 'score': 9.127517700195312}, {'text': 'Calceus, Latin for shoe or boot, was hobnailed footwear secured by laces in ancient Rome. Mulleus calceus were a red or purple shoe worn by the three highest magistrates in Ancient Rome.', 'node_id': '6350981e-5f89-49f4-9bee-1be0997c286c', 'score': 8.32862663269043}, {'text': "A jazz shoe is a type of shoe worn by dancers. They are used in jazz dance and other styles of dance including acro dance, acrobatic rock'n'roll, and hip hop, and in other activities, such as aerobics.", 'node_id': '6f06e1f0-d629-41ee-82e9-8ce015912482', 'score': 8.237391471862793}, {'text': 'Carlos Arturo Bacca Ahumada (] ; born 8 September 1986) is a Colombian professional footballer who plays as a striker for Spanish club Villarreal on loan from Milan and the Colombia national team.', 'node_id': '5836a56b-4a30-4aae-b8d9-e4d38cddf9a5', 'score': 8.048698425292969}, {'text': 'A pointe shoe is a type of shoe worn by ballet dancers when performing pointe work. Pointe shoes were conceived in response to the desire for dancers to appear weightless and sylph-like and have evolved to enable dancers to dance "en pointe" (on the tips of their toes) for extended periods of time. They are manufactured in a variety of colors, most commonly in shades of light pink.', 'node_id': 'babedbd3-6795-49e0-8ab6-5cd3b4642b49', 'score': 7.513962745666504}, {'text': 'Lionard Pajoy (born June 7, 1981) is a Colombian striker who currently plays for Alianza Lima of the Primera División Peruana.', 'node_id': 'ea20961f-3cc2-4c8a-8eb4-aab0ea5812e2', 'score': 7.023229122161865}, {'text': 'Danny Manuel Santoya (born 24 April 1988) is a Colombian striker, who plays for Peruvian side Deportivo Municipal.', 'node_id': '806a4419-ed06-4e49-8429-1f62171e39c9', 'score': 7.023229122161865}, {'text': "Víctor Manuel Bonilla Hinestroza (born 23 January 1971 in Tumaco) is a retired Colombian striker, more commonly known as 'Big Vic'.", 'node_id': '4cd94bdd-9dc0-48f5-8a8a-a78068e141c5', 'score': 6.815459251403809}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 4.063843449577689, 'vram_usage': 0.0}
