 15%|█▍        | 74/500 [15:01<1:16:57, 10.84s/it] 15%|█▌        | 75/500 [15:06<1:05:09,  9.20s/it]['yes'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding the release year of "Up." However, "The Watercolor" was released on November 13, 2009. Without information about the release year of "Up," I cannot determine if they were released in the same year.', 'query': 'Were Up and The Watercolor released in the same year?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': '"The Watercolor (Tr: Suluboya)" is a 2009 Turkish animated film, directed by Cihat Hazardağlı. The film went on nationwide general release on November 13, 2009.', 'node_id': '3142ab62-1bc3-4a8f-9a96-4e40f653ab44', 'score': 1.098404884338379}, {'text': "by Waters' band Contribution in 2004.", 'node_id': '8df862e1-b2ff-4c20-9060-84ec920ee78b', 'score': 1.1194509267807007}, {'text': 'The EP was released on the 6th of May and features 5 songs from her debut album, as well as a cover of Canadian singer Joni Mitchell\'s "A Case of You". In 2015, Aplin released her second studio album entitled "Light Up the Dark". "Light Up the Dark" debuted at number 14 on the UK Albums Chart.', 'node_id': '3d870243-d7f4-4565-a0e6-da70bc4a286f', 'score': 1.1404460668563843}, {'text': 'Production began in May 2000 and ended in August 2000, and took place largely on location in London and the Home Counties. The film premiered on 4 April 2001 in the UK and was released to theatres on 13 April 2001 simultaneously in the UK and in the US.', 'node_id': '309c7c8b-0970-4d44-96f4-6a1a18346bd3', 'score': 1.1482653617858887}, {'text': 'Two singles were released from the album, "Round & Round" and "A Year Without Rain".', 'node_id': 'df391de7-b514-4b3c-99c7-533495a37b2b', 'score': 1.1585432291030884}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.8592809569090605, 'vram_usage': 1.16552734375}
