['La Fea Mas Bella'] {'response': 'The 32nd TCA Awards were hosted by Jaime Camil, a Mexican actor best known for his role as Fernando Mendiola in "La Fea Mas Bella." This event took place on August 6, 2016, at The Beverly Hilton in Beverly Hills, California. Jaime Camil is recognized for his contributions to television and film, particularly for his memorable performances in various roles, including that of Fernando Mendiola.', 'query': 'The 32nd TCA Awards were hosted by a  Mexican actor best known for his roles as Fernando Mendiola in what?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Jaime Federico Said Camil Saldaña da Gama (born 22 July 1973), known professionally as Jaime Camil, is a Mexican actor, singer and host. He is best known for his roles as Fernando Mendiola in "La Fea Mas Bella" and Rogelio de la Vega in "Jane the Virgin."', 'node_id': 'dad2b126-7323-4487-ace0-ed171f874a39', 'score': 16.231706619262695}, {'text': 'The 32nd TCA Awards were held on August 6, 2016, in a ceremony hosted by Jaime Camil at The Beverly Hilton in Beverly Hills, California. The nominees were announced by the Television Critics Association on June 22, 2016.', 'node_id': 'c13b1f45-ae8c-4197-81d6-f0cfdc4eb4c0', 'score': 11.931702613830566}, {'text': 'The 22nd TCA Awards were presented by the Television Critics Association. Mary Lynn Rajskub hosted the ceremony on July 23, 2006 at the Huntington Hotel and Spa in Pasadena, California.', 'node_id': 'e64085ee-5630-404d-aaab-8124271db91a', 'score': 8.79467487335205}, {'text': 'Fernando Fernández "El Crooner de México" (1916–1999) was a Mexican actor and singer. He was born on November 9, 1916, in Monterrey, Mexico, and died in Mexico City, Mexico, on November 24, 1999. Fernando was the son of Eloisa Reyes. He was brother of the famous film director Emilio Fernández and actor Jaime Fernández. He was married to singer Lupita Palomera, who died in 2008. Fernando Fernández was known as "the Crooner of Mexico."', 'node_id': '0bab1cef-4752-4b39-b0e2-bd5a82addfbe', 'score': 8.637495040893555}, {'text': 'José Ángel Llamas Olmos (born October 13, 1966) is a Mexican actor best known for his roles of Rudolfo in Amor descarado. His striking good looks make him quite the heart throb among his many fans.', 'node_id': 'fde867ce-8635-4fec-9148-039545761da4', 'score': 8.555635452270508}, {'text': 'August 32nd on Earth (French: Un 32 août sur terre , and also known as "32nd Day of August on Earth") is a 1998 Canadian drama film directed by Denis Villeneuve. It was screened in the Un Certain Regard section at the 1998 Cannes Film Festival. Alexis Martin won the Prix Jutra for Best Actor. The film was selected as the Canadian entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 71st Academy Awards, but was not nominated.', 'node_id': 'e2ef024b-4f27-4643-885d-3df9c88dcc4e', 'score': 7.891498565673828}, {'text': 'Other changes include Best Film and Best British Film being renamed this year only to "Best Movie" and "Best British Movie" respectively. The honorary Lifetime Achievement Award was presented for the last time. English actor Bill Bailey hosted the show for the second time, having previously hosted the 9th ceremony held in 2004. The awards were sponsored by Sony Ericsson for the fourth consecutive year.', 'node_id': '096bb9a0-c768-467f-a3fb-4d8bb2c72363', 'score': 7.778332233428955}, {'text': 'This is the complete filmography of Russell Crowe throughout his entire career. Crowe has acted in blockbuster films such as "Gladiator" (2000), a historical epic for which he won the Academy Award for Best Actor. He is also a winner of the BAFTA Award for Best Actor in a Leading Role and Golden Globe Award for Best Actor – Motion Picture Drama for his portrayal of John Forbes Nash Jr. in the biographical drama "A Beautiful Mind" (2001).', 'node_id': '4cc31ffa-4d2f-4ef9-ab3e-03e22696fb1f', 'score': 7.543715000152588}, {'text': 'For his performance Cruise received the Golden Globe Award for Best Actor\xa0– Motion Picture Drama and his first nomination for the Academy Award for Best Actor.', 'node_id': 'f58745c0-5d6c-4f34-9b0c-ffd8b74033bb', 'score': 7.268802642822266}, {'text': 'Indian Telly Award for Best Actor in a Lead Role – Male is an award given by IndianTelevision.com as part of its annual Indian Telly Awards for TV serials, to recognize a male actor who has delivered an outstanding performance in a leading role.', 'node_id': '842a5f5b-6c80-445d-ac4c-1e125f1e849b', 'score': 7.253868579864502}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.5790789052844048, 'vram_usage': 0.0}
