in 1974. She reached the third round of the U.S. Open in 1973 and 1978. She won all 4 of her Fed Cup matches for the U.S. in 1974.', 'node_id': '7155b2fe-242d-419a-8858-af7d45bfbe19', 'score': 0.9403890371322632}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.801875164732337, 'vram_usage': 1.21240234375}
