3-8c1b-4af75e744b55', 'score': 1.0444252490997314}, {'text': "A Seaside Rendezvous was a 2009 duo of concerts by English alternative rock band Muse. Held at The Den in Teignmouth, Devon, the town in which the band's members spent their childhoods and began their musical careers, the homecoming concerts were the band's first shows in the town for 15 years. It is believed that the name 'Seaside Rendezvous' was taken from the Queen song of the same name (Queen being a major influence on the band).", 'node_id': '9d6efd05-953d-4c09-818c-fe17c1ab5ea8', 'score': 1.0610851049423218}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.2247898895293474, 'vram_usage': 1.18896484375}
