his year because of his retirement from professional tennis in September 2012.<br>', 'node_id': '85228e7e-9683-486d-ba75-856d22604036', 'score': 0.7577487230300903}, {'text': 'Stefanie Maria "Steffi" Graf (] ; born 14 June 1969) is a German former tennis player, who was ranked world No. 1 during her career. Graf won 22 Grand Slam singles titles. Her 22 singles titles put her second on the list of Major wins in the female competition since the introduction of the Open Era in 1968 and is third all-time behind Margaret Court (24) and Serena Williams (23).', 'node_id': 'fb4d3676-c832-4d7b-8b02-0264858b9d23', 'score': 0.7616937756538391}, {'text': 'This is a list of the main career statistics of Spanish professional tennis player, Garbiñe Muguruza. To date, Muguruza has won five WTA singles titles – most significantly the 2016 French Open and the 2017 Wimbledon Championships– and five WTA doubles titles.', 'node_id': '251edb63-3de4-4372-996e-a0940a13cb0a', 'score': 0.8356404304504395}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.2012487165629864, 'vram_usage': 1.23583984375}
