nds until joining in the summer of 1995 with the group The Pale Ones, which would later change their name to Slipknot. Of Slipknot's nine-member lineup which lasted from 1999–2010, Joey was the third to join the band.", 'node_id': '0757f5e3-f03e-4a4c-b517-7f40ff13ebda', 'score': 1.1531537771224976}, {'text': 'He also starred as a lead actor in "Pehla Nasha" (1993). Tijori started his directing career with "Oops!" (2003), a film about male strippers. This was followed by "Fareb" (2005), "Khamoshh... Khauff Ki Raat" (2005), "Tom, Dick, and Harry" (2006) and "Fox" (2009).', 'node_id': '6e44b21e-1676-43b3-bf7e-1a13d5a36b73', 'score': 1.1627399921417236}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.6334693673998117, 'vram_usage': 1.20068359375}
