hority area in the Yorkshire and the Humber region of England, bordering the unitary authority of North Lincolnshire and the non-metropolitan county of Lincolnshire. The population of the Unitary Authority at the 2011 Census was 159,616. These three administrative units make up the ceremonial county of Lincolnshire.', 'node_id': '81b815ba-51ce-45be-8312-e670eefcd232', 'score': 1.0895540714263916}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.6547848507761955, 'vram_usage': 1.15380859375}
