om 1966 to 1968, researching, developing, and raising money for the new series. Cooney was named as the Workshop\'s first executive director, which was termed "one of the most important television developments of the decade".', 'node_id': '765b4847-0599-43f9-acab-0b910cc7c850', 'score': 1.2887778282165527}, {'text': 'David Earl is a British actor and comedian, best known for his comedy character Brian Gittins. He has featured in several projects associated with Ricky Gervais, most notably as Kevin \'Kev\' Twine in the sitcom "Derek", and in smaller roles in "Extras" and the film "Cemetery Junction". He also co-wrote and starred in the sitcom "Rovers" for Sky 1 with Joe Wilkinson.', 'node_id': '88c3023d-ea04-4fab-82e7-f6f906c62b66', 'score': 1.2897717952728271}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.0865394826978445, 'vram_usage': 1.37646484375}
