ociated with Ricky Gervais, most notably as Kevin \'Kev\' Twine in the sitcom "Derek", and in smaller roles in "Extras" and the film "Cemetery Junction". He also co-wrote and starred in the sitcom "Rovers" for Sky 1 with Joe Wilkinson.', 'node_id': '88c3023d-ea04-4fab-82e7-f6f906c62b66', 'score': 1.2897717952728271}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.6504049822688103, 'vram_usage': 1.37646484375}
