9e99f2', 'score': 0.9804190397262573}, {'text': 'He is currently Director of Player Development for the Tampa Bay Lightning of the National Hockey League.', 'node_id': '759d4c5b-8aed-4f5c-97bb-bf4ba6200fbd', 'score': 1.0969007015228271}, {'text': "In 1891, the Canadian assets of the company were purchased by its chief rival there, the Hudson's Bay Company.", 'node_id': 'c27659bd-c203-4eea-b619-d4263edad43d', 'score': 1.1195311546325684}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.8662866819649935, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
