; Katniss Everdeen and fellow District 12 tribute Peeta Mellark have returned home safely after winning the 74th Annual Hunger Games.', 'node_id': '9b261f61-e1e6-490e-a0da-41c652281df4', 'score': 1.196866750717163}, {'text': '"She is known for doing selective films and portraying variety of well written and challenging roles.', 'node_id': '1dcd308b-afbf-41fb-8bd5-875b88dae4a6', 'score': 1.229381799697876}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8516464624553919, 'vram_usage': 1.15380859375}
