Janny Brandes-Brilleslijper, Anne's fellow prisoner in all three camps. Both women, who were cell mates with Anne and Anne's sister Margot, are believed to be among the last known people to have seen Anne alive.", 'node_id': '8431a2bd-ad64-4a17-ba75-8f4e168a67f9', 'score': 1.1966187953948975}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.7324700020253658, 'vram_usage': 1.21240234375}
