p rallies, parades, and the annual Orange and Blue spring scrimmage game. A full band usually travels to one away game a year while at other games a small/medium-sized pep band will attend.", 'node_id': '6da6f915-8114-48da-b3be-b22dd2d0a948', 'score': 1.1063892841339111}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.5985926985740662, 'vram_usage': 1.25927734375}
