ed the role of Detective Stan "Wojo" Wojciehowicz on the television sitcom "Barney Miller".', 'node_id': 'f5b98f39-b594-479c-ad90-8317e3bb3094', 'score': 0.8515191078186035}, {'text': 'Carey appeared in the recurring role for the last six of the eight seasons of "Barney Miller"\' s run. He first appeared on the show as a criminal, Angelo Molinari (aka The Mole), in Season 2, Episode 22.', 'node_id': '62f3caeb-607c-4a16-b602-ce8d431aff82', 'score': 0.885746955871582}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.117037646472454, 'vram_usage': 1.27099609375}
