['Lyudmila Stefanovna Petrushevskaya'] {'response': 'The Time: Night is a novella by Lyudmila Stefanovna Petrushevskaya, who is a Russian writer, novelist, and playwright. She was born on May 26, 1938, and is known for her contributions to literature, including this particular work, which was originally published in the literary journal "Novy Mir" in 1992.', 'query': 'The Time: Night, is a novella by which Russian writer, novelist and playwright?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'The Time: Night (Russian: Время ночь ) is a novella by Russian author Lyudmila Petrushevskaya. It was originally published in Russian in the literary journal "Novy Mir" in 1992 and translated into English by Sally Laird in 1994. In 1992 it was shortlisted for the Russian Booker Prize.', 'node_id': 'ff65b197-07b2-4edd-8663-a2183809cb3f', 'score': 0.2489418387413025}, {'text': 'Sonechka is a novella and collection of short stories by Russian writer Lyudmila Ulitskaya. It was originally published in Russian in the literary journal "Novy Mir" in 1992, and translated into English by Arch Tait in 2005. "Sonechka" was nominated for the Russian Booker Prize.', 'node_id': '58822c0d-748d-4eb1-92a2-8e18c0c472b5', 'score': 0.9778958559036255}, {'text': 'Uncle\'s Dream (Russian: Дядюшкин сон , "Dyadushkin son") is an 1859 novella by Russian writer Fyodor Dostoyevsky.', 'node_id': 'b2534eaf-82d7-49d8-af81-f922dcabd509', 'score': 0.9826958775520325}, {'text': 'There writing under the pseudonym Marlinsky (Russian: Марли́нский ; ] ) he became known as a romantic poet, short story writer and novelist. He was killed there in a skirmish.', 'node_id': 'cf6d099b-0cdc-4d76-98ed-6046f40eba95', 'score': 1.0106688737869263}, {'text': 'As a writer he is best known for the novella "The Remote House on Vasilyevsky Island" (Уединённый домик на Васильевском), which was influenced by the writings of Aleksandr Pushkin.', 'node_id': '61348308-41dd-4390-bccb-bde35f80f97f', 'score': 1.0147783756256104}, {'text': 'The character development of the protagonist parallels another biblical figure, Job. The producer Alexander Rodnyansky has said: "It deals with some of the most important social issues of contemporary Russia while never becoming an artist\'s sermon or a public statement; it is a story of love and tragedy experienced by ordinary people". Critics noted the film as being formidable, dealing with quirks of fate, power and money.', 'node_id': '81889365-8399-478e-ab0c-db19dd32e312', 'score': 1.0163575410842896}, {'text': 'The Last Summer is a novella by the Russian writer Boris Pasternak. Originally published in 1934 under the Russian title "Povest" ("A Story"), the book relates the reminiscences of Serezha, a young Muscovite spending the winter of 1915-16 with his sister\'s family in the foothills of the Ural Mountains. Serezha\'s flashbacks to the summer of 1914, when he worked as a tutor in the house of a wealthy Moscow merchant and associated with various women, form the bulk of the novella.', 'node_id': '7355b86c-fcce-4968-8aee-5e6e7fed95ba', 'score': 1.0333888530731201}, {'text': 'Zoya Borisovna Boguslavskaya (Russian: Зо́я Бори́совна Богусла́вская ; born April 16, 1929, Moscow, USSR) is a Soviet and Russian writer, novelist, essayist, playwright, author of major cultural projects in Russia and abroad.', 'node_id': 'aac757d1-33e0-4e12-ac97-f5c45b47dcf0', 'score': 1.0404080152511597}, {'text': 'Elisa Albert (born July 2, 1978) is the author of the short story collection "How this Night is Different (Free Press, 2006)", the novels "The Book of Dahlia (Free Press, 2008)" and "After Birth (Houghton Mifflin Harcourt, 2015)", and an anthology, "Freud\'s Blind Spot: Writers on Siblings (Free Press, 2010)".', 'node_id': 'c2a0684c-ea42-45b3-a462-0231b916f30a', 'score': 1.0764851570129395}, {'text': 'Lyudmila Stefanovna Petrushevskaya (Russian: Людмила Стефановна Петрушевская ; born 26 May 1938) is a Russian writer, novelist and playwright.', 'node_id': 'df23442f-6bb8-4216-9ed8-94a6381c94fc', 'score': 1.0779017210006714}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 1.0128982607275248, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
