93f5a73', 'score': 1.1535289287567139}, {'text': 'In order to accommodate the places which sell sake and other drinks, Coca-Cola and other soft drink makers have worked to expand the varieties of their products. One way of selling more of their goods is by lining them up next to milk and other products, which helps increase sales at places such as sentō, onsen and convenience stores.', 'node_id': 'ecefcebe-4f7a-4e0c-90c5-551070533fc9', 'score': 1.1937997341156006}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.4181592036038637, 'vram_usage': 1.15380859375}
