 'score': 1.0755831003189087}, {'text': 'Its southern terminus is at U.S. 441 on the boundary between Great Smoky Mountains National Park and the Cherokee Indian Reservation in North Carolina, from which it travels north to Shenandoah National Park in Virginia. The roadway continues through Shenandoah as Skyline Drive, a similar scenic road which is managed by a different National Park Service unit.', 'node_id': 'b4b2ce98-894d-41db-8dee-a2f6881071e3', 'score': 1.0887233018875122}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.296739498153329, 'vram_usage': 1.27099609375}
