6b0e39', 'score': 1.1083521842956543}, {'text': 'Paulina Gómez Torres (born 29 July 1991) known professionally as Paulina Goto is a Mexican actress, singer, and television hostess, who first gained popularity for her debut role in the Mexican telenovela "Niña de mi Corazón" in 2010. She was a member of the popular Mexican-Argentine pop group, Eme 15, formed by Televisa producer Pedro Damián, from 2011 to 2014.', 'node_id': '33538c3b-7138-4161-9ad1-95ace43f941d', 'score': 1.1494202613830566}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.3443209640681744, 'vram_usage': 1.23583984375}
