['Quinceañera'] {'response': 'The telenovela that inspired the TV show on which the band Eme 15 was formed in 2012 is "Quinceañera," which was originally released in 1987. The series "Miss XV," produced by Pedro Damián for Nickelodeon and Canal 5, is a modern adaptation of this classic telenovela. "Miss XV" features themes surrounding the coming-of-age celebration known as a quinceañera, which is central to the storyline. Thus, "Quinceañera" serves as the foundational inspiration for "Miss XV," leading to the formation of Eme 15 as part of the show\'s musical component.', 'query': 'What telenovela inspired the TV show that the band Eme 15 was formed on in 2012?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Carrossel (Portuguese word for "Carousel") is a children\'s telenovela created by and written by Abel Santa Cruz. The TV show originally transmitted on SBT from May 21, 2012 to July 26, 2013. It involves a Brazilian remake of the Mexican telenovela Carrusel (which in turn had been inspired by the Argentinean telenovela "Jacinta Pichimahuida, la Maestra que no se Olvida").', 'node_id': '8082758d-60a6-4752-b968-4a4da7877831', 'score': 10.388899803161621}, {'text': 'Eme 15 (also stylized as "EME XV" and "M-15") were a Mexican Latin pop band composed of the six lead actors from the 2012 Nickelodeon Latin America television series "Miss XV". The band was formed for the series in Mexico City by Televisa by producer Pedro Damián in August 2011. Music for the band\'s album was produced and written by Carlos Lara and former pop-rock singer Lynda Thomas.', 'node_id': 'd061e1a3-2b90-4fdf-b94d-4f10f3731e95', 'score': 9.729902267456055}, {'text': 'Miss XV (sometimes stylized as "Miss 15") is a Mexican teen musical television series, it was inspired by the 1987 telenovela "Quinceañera". Pedro Damián produced the series for Nickelodeon and Canal 5 in 2012.', 'node_id': 'ea4d48c2-5d4b-40d3-90b9-8aa2db6b0e39', 'score': 9.358603477478027}, {'text': 'Robert Jack Duarte Wallace (born April 7, 1986 in Mexico City, Distrito Federal) is a Mexican actor and singer. He is known for his acting performance in the Mexican telenovela "Rebelde" as "Tomas Goycolea"" and as a member of the Mexican-Argentine pop band, "Eme 15".', 'node_id': '1f09e11a-5471-4f2e-95cb-4a505771a555', 'score': 8.844475746154785}, {'text': 'Eme 15 is the self-titled debut studio album by Mexican-Argentine pop band, Eme 15. The album was released in Mexico and Latin America on June 26, 2012 through Warner Music México, and features songs from the Nickelodeon Latin America and Televisa musical television series, Miss XV.', 'node_id': '15499338-3bfb-4ce0-89d4-45e3dd620b34', 'score': 8.695889472961426}, {'text': 'Natasha Elizabeth Dupeyrón Estrada (born 3 June 1991 in Mexico City, Mexico) known professionally as Natasha Dupeyron, is a Mexican actress and singer. She has acted in various Mexican telenovelas since childhood. Dupeyrón was a member of the Mexican-Argentine pop band, Eme 15 from 2011 until 2014.', 'node_id': '9a783dc1-6953-479d-9b67-08742bd512b5', 'score': 8.238729476928711}, {'text': 'José Eleazar Gómez Sanchez (] ; better known as Eleazar Gómez born May 29, 1986 in Mexico City, Mexico) is a Mexican actor. He is noted for his performance in Mexican telenovelas. Gómez is the brother of actress Zoraida Gómez and actor Jairo Gómez. He is a member of the Mexican pop band Eme 15.', 'node_id': 'f7f7051c-4219-48df-b35f-2270247692cd', 'score': 8.145747184753418}, {'text': 'Paulina Gómez Torres (born 29 July 1991) known professionally as Paulina Goto is a Mexican actress, singer, and television hostess, who first gained popularity for her debut role in the Mexican telenovela "Niña de mi Corazón" in 2010. She was a member of the popular Mexican-Argentine pop group, Eme 15, formed by Televisa producer Pedro Damián, from 2011 to 2014.', 'node_id': '33538c3b-7138-4161-9ad1-95ace43f941d', 'score': 7.618390083312988}, {'text': 'Wonderland-Zona Preferente (also known as Wonderland Live (Zona Preferente)) is the first live album by Mexican-Argentine Latin pop band Eme 15. The album was recorded at the Auditorio Nacional in Mexico City on January 27, 2013.', 'node_id': 'a9da93ca-5f96-4503-b714-a123998db000', 'score': 6.069913864135742}, {'text': 'Macarena Achaga Figueroa (] ; born 5 March 1992 in Mar del Plata, Argentina) known professionally as Macarena Achaga, is an Argentine model, actress, singer, and television hostess. In 2012, she debuted as an actress on the Mexican television series "Miss XV" and was a member of the Mexican-Argentine pop group, Eme 15, from 2011 to 2014.', 'node_id': 'c2e4ed71-df94-40b8-8f57-26b30ec5260f', 'score': 5.693378925323486}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.168528376147151, 'vram_usage': 0.0}
