e is the son of English actor Henry Goodman. He has appeared extensively on stage in the UK including the UK premieres of Adam Rapp's Red Light Winter Lynn Nottage's Intimate Apparel, and Joshua Harmon's Bad Jews.", 'node_id': '7f95cb21-5ac2-4763-adc5-ccae8645eef4', 'score': 1.209533929824829}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.6946572065353394, 'vram_usage': 1.13037109375}
