1104506254196167}, {'text': 'Liverpool Football Club ( ) is a professional association football club based in Liverpool, Merseyside, England. They compete in the Premier League, the top tier of English football. The club has won an English record 5 European Cups, 3 UEFA Cups, 3 UEFA Super Cups, 18 League titles, 7 FA Cups, a record 8 League Cups, and 15 FA Community Shields.', 'node_id': '838f218c-a3e8-4231-96df-39a3bc21913d', 'score': 1.1332085132598877}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.7513035014271736, 'vram_usage': 1.31787109375}
