 the Caribbean region by passenger traffic.', 'node_id': 'b790998c-88e5-4062-9933-7944fcf8ced3', 'score': 0.9118679761886597}, {'text': 'OR Tambo International Airport is in the Kempton Park area of Ekurhuleni.', 'node_id': 'da256490-8bfd-4df0-978c-fdae771004a3', 'score': 0.9613943696022034}, {'text': 'Aerostar Airport Holdings, LLC is the public–private partnership, privately held company, and limited liability company that operates and manages the Luis Muñoz Marín International Airport on behalf of the Puerto Rico Ports Authority. The company is an equitable joint venture between Highstar Capital, an infrastructure investment firm, and Grupo Aeroportuario del Sureste, a Mexican airport management firm. Aerostar has a forty-year lease to manage and upgrade the airport, including the investment of nearly $1.4 billion in capital improvements over the course of the lease.', 'node_id': '738f2366-6b05-4040-b27a-a80706f79329', 'score': 1.1269670724868774}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.7186475265771151, 'vram_usage': 1.31787109375}
