final appearance on the Top-10 country singles chart arrived a year later as part of a duet recording with Randy Travis. In spite of the lack of radio hits as the 1990s dawned Jones remained a popular concert draw for the next two decades and continued to release original recordings into the mid 2000s.', 'node_id': '1fa6518e-dafd-4902-af40-08bbec82c5d6', 'score': 1.014079213142395}, {'text': 'Lewis released a whopping 26 Country charted singles from 1966 to 1985, with 14 for United Artists, 5 for Ace Of Hearts, two with GRT, 3 for RPA and one each for Capricorn and HME. Lewis also released a total of 9 albums with United Artists.', 'node_id': 'c50b7341-0f76-40f9-a68e-f4b0cbd425c0', 'score': 1.04083251953125}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.7626499310135841, 'vram_usage': 1.54052734375}
