h Africa. Then in another, he paid tribute to Tanzanian women, "Wanawake wa Tanzania wazuri sana." Abdullah was replaced by Juma Kilaza, but the band declined.', 'node_id': '7484a464-6ce9-4e02-94cb-4aebd0e831da', 'score': 1.0740482807159424}, {'text': 'Jon "Bowzer" Bauman (born September 14, 1947) is an American musician, best known as a member of the band Sha Na Na, and game show host. Bauman\'s popular Sha Na Na character, "Bowzer", was a gangly, slender-armed greaser in a muscle shirt.', 'node_id': 'fb613d8c-ed78-4419-9b3e-5f35c6abf040', 'score': 1.0747525691986084}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8321784939616919, 'vram_usage': 1.24755859375}
