sus was 167,446. For ceremonial purposes it is part of Lincolnshire. There are three significant towns: Scunthorpe (the administrative centre), Brigg and Barton-upon-Humber.', 'node_id': 'acd829de-d995-457f-86a2-08f754866128', 'score': 1.1181061267852783}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.2572656236588955, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
