 keeping his life in order. It co-stars Carey Mulligan, John Goodman, Garrett Hedlund, F. Murray Abraham, and Justin Timberlake.', 'node_id': 'e5288243-453b-40de-a98d-682339b08e24', 'score': 1.1389858722686768}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.8418711069971323, 'vram_usage': 1.14208984375}
