ove Me Not (; literally "Love and Such Is Not Necessary") is a 2006 South Korean romance film directed by Lee Cheol-ha and starring Moon Geun-young and Kim Joo-hyuk.', 'node_id': '958dc828-3c1c-4945-812d-11f4ff68367b', 'score': 1.1751394271850586}, {'text': 'The film is heavily influenced by the Korean movie "My Sassy Girl" and the English-language movie "You\'ve Got Mail".', 'node_id': '751a1f1a-a484-4df4-af8c-a3392bce3468', 'score': 1.1761130094528198}, {'text': 'The music for the game was composed by Nobuo Uematsu and Toshiaki Imai.', 'node_id': 'd059ce94-1050-4166-bab4-e576a6997ea6', 'score': 1.1837220191955566}, {'text': "It is one of the world's most widely known books and has been the basis for several plays and films.", 'node_id': '01c1f83d-e59c-4177-af8e-81b02c463770', 'score': 1.1897847652435303}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.8022275418043137, 'vram_usage': 1.32958984375}
