sed road tunnel and connects to various hiking and horse riding trails in the area.', 'node_id': '9a898a19-9033-44b5-9a2d-8a74c1f0f27d', 'score': 0.8765945434570312}, {'text': 'Fontana Dam (also known as Fontana Village) is a town in Graham County, North Carolina, United States. Fontana Dam is located on North Carolina Highway 28 near the Fontana Dam and the Little Tennessee River. The town incorporated in 2011 and has a full-time population of 33.', 'node_id': 'c8bd98aa-02db-4d60-9870-5e59cd877a54', 'score': 0.9175077676773071}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.74714520201087, 'vram_usage': 1.20068359375}
