tive album by American ambient musicians Steve Roach, Jeffrey Fayman and guest musicians Robert Fripp and Momodou Kah.', 'node_id': '8a5453e2-bac9-4840-a426-a9aa8f2acef2', 'score': 1.178739309310913}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.8562558200210333, 'vram_usage': 1.38818359375}
