t seasons of Sa Re Ga Ma Pa. Two teams were competing against each other each week starting October 30, 2009, to head towards the finales.', 'node_id': '4dbc1579-43b7-43ae-9e2b-9a8d087fafac', 'score': 0.9581359624862671}, {'text': 'The show features two of the previous mentors, Himesh Reshammiya and Ismail Darbar, and two new mentors to the Challenge series, Bappi Lahiri and Vishal-Shekhar. Shaan did not return to host and was replaced by Aditya Narayan, son of playback singer, Udit Narayan.', 'node_id': '0a016429-fa63-49dd-a4d0-0a353c3f572d', 'score': 0.9987062811851501}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.5617261733859777, 'vram_usage': 1.24755859375}
