ork State Route\xa0146A (NY\xa0146A) is a state highway in New York State. It begins at NY\xa0146 in Clifton Park and ends at NY\xa050 in Ballston Lake. It is located entirely within Saratoga County. Route\xa0146A is the last existing spur of NY\xa0146 in Saratoga and Schenectady counties.', 'node_id': '8eeeef27-fc45-4747-9a4f-ac18fecda8bf', 'score': 0.6596602201461792}, {'text': 'New York State Route\xa0337 (NY\xa0337) is a short state highway located entirely within the Town of Rotterdam in Schenectady County, New York. It forms a connection from NY\xa07 to Interstate\xa0890 along the western edge of the city of Schenectady and passes by the Rotterdam Square shopping mall.', 'node_id': 'b317d09d-2624-40d2-8871-dce47736eaa0', 'score': 0.7087340950965881}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.7394380997866392, 'vram_usage': 1.28271484375}
