 cameo appearances by Western film actors, country music stars and other actors.', 'node_id': '1c541e45-6ada-410b-91eb-7a2163ef8f49', 'score': 1.194899559020996}, {'text': 'Rather than replicate, Van Gogh sought to translate the subjects and composition through his perspective, color, and technique. Spiritual meaning and emotional comfort were expressed through symbolism and color. His brother Theo van Gogh would call the pieces in the series some of his best work.', 'node_id': '665d2225-78e4-4b93-b6ce-a571f3b6becd', 'score': 1.1969501972198486}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.9051238503307104, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
