the Brong-Ahafo Region in Ghana. Yeji is in the north-east of Brong-Ahafo Region, and is adjacent to Lake Volta. Yeji is connected by highway to Ejura and Kwadjokrom. It had a population of 29,515 at the census of 2010.', 'node_id': '7af0f1aa-8d1d-48db-9dec-9736bfe30b21', 'score': 1.1562445163726807}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8625807669013739, 'vram_usage': 1.16552734375}
