 industry which was produced by Adinarayana Rao on Anjali Pictures banner and directed by Vedantam Raghavaiah. Starring Akkineni Nageswara Rao, Anjali Devi in the lead roles and music also composed by Adinarayana Rao.', 'node_id': 'ac213a91-064f-43b0-8b6b-d08c5e1f66c8', 'score': 1.0760273933410645}, {'text': 'The film is being directed by David Leitch from a script by Rhett Reese and Paul Wernick, with Ryan Reynolds starring in the title role alongside Morena Baccarin, T. J. Miller, Leslie Uggams, Brianna Hildebrand, Stefan Kapičić, Zazie Beetz, Josh Brolin, and Jack Kesy.', 'node_id': 'c4a94369-e7df-41ea-84e8-22de6f60bd2f', 'score': 1.0918166637420654}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.9845533594489098, 'vram_usage': 1.35302734375}
