['"Cosmicomics"'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding Italo Calvino\'s works that are of the same genre as Richard Yates\' "Eleven Kinds of Loneliness". While it mentions Calvino\'s best-known works, it does not specify if any of them are in the same genre as Yates\' short story collection.', 'query': 'Richard Yates published a work by the name of "Eleven Kinds of Loneliness", one of Italo Calvino\'s best known works was of the same genre and named what?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Eleven Kinds of Loneliness is a collection of short stories written by Richard Yates from 1951 to 1961. All of the stories in "Eleven Kinds of Loneliness" also appeared in the posthumously released "Collected Stories of Richard Yates" (2001).', 'node_id': 'fd2644e8-0382-434c-968b-ee58edc31fd7', 'score': 0.4716227054595947}, {'text': 'Richard Yates (February 3, 1926 – November 7, 1992) was an American fiction writer, identified with the mid-century "Age of Anxiety". His first novel, "Revolutionary Road", was a finalist for the 1962 National Book Award. His first short story collection, "Eleven Kinds of Loneliness", brought comparisons to James Joyce.', 'node_id': '17acb4c1-25c7-41e6-96e1-62ff51fb59c2', 'score': 0.7404550909996033}, {'text': 'He is the author of several collections of poetry, including "The God of Loneliness, Selected and New Poems" (Houghton Mifflin Harcourt, 2010); "Failure" (Harcourt, 2007), winner of the 2008 Pulitzer Prize in Poetry; "Living in the Past" (Harcourt, 2004); and "The Holy Worm of Praise" (Harcourt, 2002).', 'node_id': '00118c21-6146-42c5-b887-f2ab15301f86', 'score': 1.175696849822998}, {'text': "It is one of the world's most widely known books and has been the basis for several plays and films.", 'node_id': '01c1f83d-e59c-4177-af8e-81b02c463770', 'score': 1.2476415634155273}, {'text': 'Italo Calvino (] ; 15 October 1923 – 19 September 1985) was an Italian journalist and writer of short stories and novels. His best known works include the "Our Ancestors" trilogy (1952–1959), the "Cosmicomics" collection of short stories (1965), and the novels "Invisible Cities" (1972) and "If on a winter\'s night a traveler" (1979).', 'node_id': '0449e5ef-8d07-4cb7-ab99-90d54e702f71', 'score': 1.2518560886383057}, {'text': 'Mr. Palomar is a 1983 novel by the Italian writer Italo Calvino. Its original Italian title is Palomar. In an interview with Gregory Lucente, Calvino stated that he began writing "Mr. Palomar" in 1975, making it a predecessor to earlier published works such as "If on a winter\'s night a traveler". "Mr. Palomar" was published in an English translation by William Weaver in 1985.', 'node_id': '68b0f46d-bd78-4113-a362-b4836f7e6b33', 'score': 1.2944343090057373}, {'text': 'Bridget Jones\'s Diary is a 2001 British-American-French romantic comedy film directed by Sharon Maguire and written by Richard Curtis, Andrew Davies, and Helen Fielding. It is based on Fielding\'s novel of the same name, which is a reinterpretation of Jane Austen\'s "Pride and Prejudice". The adaptation stars Renée Zellweger as Bridget, Hugh Grant as the caddish Daniel Cleaver, and Colin Firth as Bridget\'s "true love", Mark Darcy.', 'node_id': '46b90677-0840-4af1-aad6-1f39c348db80', 'score': 1.3208863735198975}, {'text': 'Schultz is also the author of a memoir, "My Dyslexia", published by W.W. Norton in 2011, and a new book of poetry, "The Wherewithal" (W. W. Norton), published in February 2014.', 'node_id': '52d95d9f-e8ae-4ce0-bfb4-6c3e607cc638', 'score': 1.3375818729400635}, {'text': 'While seen as highly influential upon the genre as a whole, the novel was particularly formative in the (later-named) subgenres of fairytale fantasy and high fantasy.', 'node_id': '85616976-f244-4400-9ae7-eeadf6058754', 'score': 1.3387198448181152}, {'text': 'A Casual Introduction 1981/2001 is an album by Scottish musician Edwyn Collins. It is a collection of both his solo work and also work of Orange Juice, the band he fronted from 1979 to the mid-80s.', 'node_id': '45462d9b-559b-470c-95e9-56c617a2c223', 'score': 1.342228651046753}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 4.967823566868901, 'vram_usage': 1.44677734375}
