ilm recorded as "blockbuster" at the box office.', 'node_id': '45502e87-dded-4d72-8e34-c9dd16737899', 'score': 1.111376166343689}, {'text': 'The film stars Ankush Hazra, Mimi Chakraborty in lead role. The film is a remake of the 2007 Kannada film "Milana".', 'node_id': '08dd471b-2662-4060-8699-497413a78c94', 'score': 1.1164495944976807}, {'text': 'Malayalam: മനോജ് നെല്ലിയാട്ട് ശ്യാമളന്\u200d born 6 August 1970) is an Indian American film director, screenwriter, author, producer, and actor known for making movies with contemporary supernatural plots and surprise endings.', 'node_id': '4c5a3370-de65-41ec-ad00-b40599726849', 'score': 1.1177514791488647}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.8092938512563705, 'vram_usage': 1.43505859375}
